    "title_en": "On Pionic Radioactivity",
    "abstract_en": "The papers on the theoretical basis for the pion radioactivity hypothesis and the results of experiments aimed at its discovery are reviewed. Based on the analysis of the available information, it is concluded that there are no physical grounds for the existence of pion radioactivity as a new type of radioactive decay.",
